{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣歌手王力宏日前於廣州舉行巡唱，並邀得庾澄慶（哈林）擔任嘉賓，兩人過去曾效力同一間唱片公司，私底下交情深厚，25年前王力宏受邀登上哈林主持的節目《音樂大不同》，並合唱歌曲《靠近》，成為不少歌迷心中的經典回憶。</p><p>25年後，這首歌又成為兩位金曲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.734001+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T16:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.656028+00:00","content_hash":"c0ca7d09d06b846ffa04ef3d3ec4199a2b9cf00114e57f67acbb92ce4fb8895d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}